---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Utilities - Ferment UI">
  <main>
    <h1>Utilities</h1>
    <p>Utility classes for quick styling and layout adjustments.</p>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Layout Utilities</h2>
      <p>Margin, padding, display, and positioning utility classes will be documented here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Typography Utilities</h2>
      <p>Text alignment, font weight, and typography utility classes will be shown here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Color Utilities</h2>
      <p>Background color, text color, and color utility classes will be documented here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Responsive Utilities</h2>
      <p>Responsive modifier classes and breakpoint utilities will be listed here.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>